{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1471127-tc-assassins-art-of-killing-black-box-session-story","id":1471127,"title":"[TC Assassins] Art of Killing - Black Box & Session Story","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-22T23:05:14-08:00","id":1471127,"title":"[TC Assassins] Art of Killing - Black Box & Session Story","content":"Topic for <b>TC Assassins</b> new planned murder mechanic - <b><i>Black Box &amp; Session Story</i> </b>- i.e. killing scenes from <b>John Wick</b>'s series or assassinations missions from <b>Assassin's Creed</b> series. Some main terms quoted from <b>TC </b><b>Assassins</b> previews, for good communication.<br /> <br /> <b>Black Box:</b> The closed set of Fields describing the overall area in which the assassination will occur with the target unawares at the start. More generally, a holistic system term for the entire assassination session.<br /> <b>Opportunity:</b> A decisive advantage or unique method for the Assassin to kill their target, generated by successfully completing a Session Story.<br /> <b>Points of Ingress:</b> Tracks that allow a player character to undergo a Session Story, culminating in an Opportunity.<br /> <b>Session Story: </b>A vignette or side-story adjacent to the overall timeline of the target, which begins with a point of ingress and ends in an Opportunity.<br /> <b>Ticks: </b>An increment of time on a timeline. Every five ticks moves the overall mission ahead in some defined way.<br /> <b>Timeline:</b> The sequence of events and pattern of life the target engages in, which all Session Stories intersect with at various points.<br /> <br /> <b>Can someone nicely sum-up how this mechanics should work in real life, on game sessions?</b> Example from preview seems a bit convoluted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-23-2021, 03:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-24T03:32:57-08:00","id":1471186,"title":"","content":"So, when you are ready to go and get rid of a target, the Timeline begins.<br /> You, as the SG, figure out what is going to happen that day. Each scene the target is involved in is a set of time which is a Session Story. So, if the target goes to a strip club, that strip club is a Session Story. It starts with a Point of Ingress which is...how do you arrive and infiltrate? Do you go in blasting or do you have a character who tries to pretend to be a dancer or do you sneak in the back door? Or do you walk in as a normal customer? That scene ends with the possibility of killing the target. If you do not end them then and there, then it moves to a new scene which is another Session Story. The strip club that I mentioned would be the Black Box...ie, the setting for the scene/Session Story.<br /> Ticks are a way to contain things and keep it orderly. Usually each Session Story is about 5 ticks. And an assassination should not go longer than 30 ticks.<br /> So, basically, the target's day (Timeline) should be about six scenes of value (Each one is a Session Story that should last about five Ticks). Each scene is at a location (Black Box) and the scene allows for an Assassin to get to the target (Point of Ingress) and can conclude with the death of the target (Opportunity) or even manipulation of events to allow the eventual ending easier.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}